WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.866 --> 00:00:15.087
Ben called to the zombies.

2
00:00:15.788 --> 00:00:18.310
The two monsters jumped at the sound of his voice.

3
00:00:20.251 --> 00:00:24.114
Then they dashed across the lobby, racing toward the construction area.

4
00:00:24.515 --> 00:00:27.757
They dodged into the construction with Ben following behind.

5
00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:29.659
"Come back here!"

6
00:00:29.979 --> 00:00:30.620
Ben shouted.

7
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:34.861
It was dark, and the zombies were a good distance away from him.

8
00:00:36.282 --> 00:00:41.244
But these zombies were taller than the zombies at Monster Academy, and—Brrpp!

9
00:00:41.884 --> 00:00:45.566
Brrpp! Suddenly an alarm blared and lights flashed on.

10
00:00:45.946 --> 00:00:47.026
Brrpp! Brrpp!

11
00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:48.487
"Don't move!"

12
00:00:48.987 --> 00:00:50.088
yelled a stern voice.

13
00:00:50.588 --> 00:00:54.350
Ben froze in terror as two museum guards ran toward him.

14
00:00:59.252 --> 00:01:00.132
caught a thief!"

15
00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:01.521
said one guard.

16
00:01:02.341 --> 00:01:03.722
His nametag read Bob.

17
00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:05.963
"It's a ghost!"

18
00:01:06.443 --> 00:01:07.264
said the other one.

19
00:01:08.064 --> 00:01:09.305
Her name was Hazel.

20
00:01:09.325 --> 00:01:13.107
"B-b-but It wasn't me!"

21
00:01:13.507 --> 00:01:17.269
Ben tried to explain everything, but the guards just stared at him.

22
00:01:17.289 --> 00:01:19.970
"Don't try to escape, ghost!"

23
00:01:20.351 --> 00:01:21.151
Bob snapped.

24
00:01:21.671 --> 00:01:23.993
"The director will be here in a minute."

25
00:01:24.573 --> 00:01:27.014
The two guards each grabbed one of Ben's arms.

26
00:01:27.895 --> 00:01:28.675
Ben moaned.

27
00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:33.858
He knew he could float away from them, but what good would it do?

28
00:01:34.419 --> 00:01:35.780
He'd just wait for Mr.

29
00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:39.222
Freaky and Miss Bungle to arrive and explain everything.

30
00:01:43.345 --> 00:01:44.125
Soon Dr.

31
00:01:44.185 --> 00:01:47.247
Bones stomped through the construction and into the lobby.

32
00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:52.090
going on here?"

33
00:01:52.591 --> 00:01:53.291
she demanded.

34
00:01:53.311 --> 00:01:58.234
"This ghost was stealing Egyptian jewelry," Hazel said.

35
00:01:58.254 --> 00:01:59.835
"But don't worry, Dr.

36
00:01:59.856 --> 00:02:02.013
Bones." She smiled proudly.

37
00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:03.414
"We caught him."

38
00:02:04.115 --> 00:02:05.536
"I didn't steal anything!"

39
00:02:05.876 --> 00:02:06.736
Ben protested.

40
00:02:06.756 --> 00:02:10.439
"Empty your pockets," Bob ordered.

41
00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:15.222
Ben did, but all he had was a gum wrapper and a few coins.

42
00:02:15.743 --> 00:02:18.845
"Where'd you put the jewels?"

43
00:02:19.485 --> 00:02:20.246
Bob demanded.

44
00:02:20.266 --> 00:02:23.648
"I didn't steal the jewels," Ben repeated.

45
00:02:23.668 --> 00:02:25.590
"But I saw who did.

46
00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:28.312
Like I said—it was two zombies!"

47
00:02:29.232 --> 00:02:29.913
"Where's Mr.

48
00:02:29.993 --> 00:02:31.374
Freaky?" Dr.

49
00:02:31.414 --> 00:02:32.215
Bones demanded.

50
00:02:32.235 --> 00:02:37.339
"I told Mayor Hubbletree that this monster visit would lead to trouble."

51
00:02:37.839 --> 00:02:39.020
She sneered at Ben.

52
00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:44.685
"But I didn't expect you monsters to steal museum treasures."

53
00:02:46.747 --> 00:02:50.590
Ben shook his head, trying to explain to the museum director now.

54
00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.572
"I saw some zombies.

55
00:02:52.912 --> 00:02:54.654
But they're not from Monster Academy!"

56
00:02:55.514 --> 00:02:57.216
Dr. Bones stared at Ben.

57
00:02:58.556 --> 00:03:00.917
"You're the only monsters here today.

58
00:03:01.457 --> 00:03:04.138
No monsters ever come to People Place."

59
00:03:04.158 --> 00:03:08.300
"Except for Uncle Tut," Ben muttered under his breath.

60
00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:09.420
But Dr.

61
00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.601
Bones had a good point.

62
00:03:11.081 --> 00:03:12.582
Where had the zombies come from?

63
00:03:12.602 --> 00:03:16.923
"We'll get to the bottom of this situation."

64
00:03:17.344 --> 00:03:19.024
Dr. Bones looked at the guards.

65
00:03:19.044 --> 00:03:22.045
"Bring this ghost to my office."

66
00:03:22.066 --> 00:03:23.786
"Yes, Dr.

67
00:03:23.826 --> 00:03:25.267
Bones," Bob said.

68
00:03:25.287 --> 00:03:26.947
"Should we call the police?"

69
00:03:26.967 --> 00:03:28.916
"No," Dr.

70
00:03:28.956 --> 00:03:29.957
Bones said quickly.

71
00:03:29.977 --> 00:03:32.959
"The museum doesn't need bad publicity.

72
00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.181
It's lucky I was working late.

73
00:03:35.741 --> 00:03:37.963
Bring the rest of the monsters too."

74
00:03:39.704 --> 00:03:43.366
The guards led Ben outside, taking the long way to Dr.

75
00:03:43.407 --> 00:03:44.287
Bones' office.

76
00:03:47.629 --> 00:03:56.496
The museum director unlocked doors with her keys as they went, relocking everything behind them.

77
00:03:58.904 --> 00:04:01.566
Soon Ben was sitting in a chair in Dr.

78
00:04:01.606 --> 00:04:02.487
Bones' office.

79
00:04:03.088 --> 00:04:06.671
Mr. Freaky paced up and down the director's office nervously.

80
00:04:06.691 --> 00:04:11.635
"Dr. Bones," the principal said.

81
00:04:11.655 --> 00:04:15.458
"Ben insists that some strangers stole the jewels.

82
00:04:16.178 --> 00:04:17.619
I'm sure he's telling the truth."

83
00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.682
Dr. Bones glared at Ben.

84
00:04:24.205 --> 00:04:26.707
"Where are these two zombies?"

85
00:04:27.307 --> 00:04:28.008
she demanded.

86
00:04:28.988 --> 00:04:34.890
She pointed to the hallway, where the rest of the monsters were lined up, looking sleepy and scared.

87
00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:37.631
"Do you see them out there?"

88
00:04:37.651 --> 00:04:43.052
Ben peered through the glass and then shook his head.

89
00:04:43.072 --> 00:04:44.713
"They're not there.

90
00:04:45.213 --> 00:04:47.794
At first I thought maybe the zombies were new students.

91
00:04:48.394 --> 00:04:50.954
But they are definitely not from Monster Academy."

92
00:04:52.195 --> 00:04:55.436
"There are exactly three zombies on this trip," Mr.

93
00:04:55.476 --> 00:04:56.136
Freaky said.

94
00:04:56.564 --> 00:04:59.266
"And they are all standing in the line outside!"

95
00:05:00.547 --> 00:05:01.809
The guards scowled.

96
00:05:01.829 --> 00:05:04.751
"That ghost is lying!"

97
00:05:05.111 --> 00:05:05.812
Hazel said.

98
00:05:05.832 --> 00:05:09.015
"Dr. Bones, we need to search everyone!"

99
00:05:12.598 --> 00:05:18.643
One by one, the guards made all the monsters come in and empty their sleeping bags, their backpacks,

100
00:05:18.943 --> 00:05:21.065
their lunchboxes, and their pockets.

101
00:05:22.886 --> 00:05:24.828
The monsters' belongings piled up.

102
00:05:33.708 --> 00:05:41.770
The guards found spell books, Mog's collection of comic books, Scary People Stories, and snacks—dried bat wings and

103
00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:42.750
crunchy spiders.

104
00:05:43.751 --> 00:05:45.771
But there were no Egyptian jewels.

105
00:05:48.112 --> 00:05:50.613
"Where did you stash the loot, ghost?"

106
00:05:51.113 --> 00:05:51.873
Bob demanded.

107
00:05:51.893 --> 00:05:55.374
"Confess!" "I didn't steal anything!"

108
00:05:55.694 --> 00:05:56.554
Ben insisted.

109
00:05:56.574 --> 00:05:59.315
"How many times do I have to tell you?"

110
00:06:00.675 --> 00:06:03.356
Mr. Freaky's noses were wiggling like mad.

111
00:06:04.532 --> 00:06:06.274
"Where's Mayor Hubbletree?

112
00:06:06.694 --> 00:06:09.516
This situation is totally out of control!"

113
00:06:10.397 --> 00:06:12.019
By now it was very late.

114
00:06:12.919 --> 00:06:14.801
Dr. Bones turned to the guards.

115
00:06:15.782 --> 00:06:16.843
She looked exhausted.

116
00:06:16.863 --> 00:06:23.068
"It's time to bring the suspect to the police station," she murmured.

117
00:06:23.088 --> 00:06:24.950
"I'll meet you there soon."

118
00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.352
"Okay, Dr.

119
00:06:27.392 --> 00:06:29.093
Bones," the guards said.

120
00:06:29.994 --> 00:06:32.336
Dr. Bones got her coat from a nearby rack.

121
00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:37.121
As she put it on, something fell out of her pocket and clattered to the floor.

122
00:06:38.644 --> 00:06:43.133
Everyone stared at the object—it was a glittering piece of golden jewelry!
